{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_title", "source_sha256": "1844efed3ac761fc88a770777b1147bac1c3daa8bc91302d5f34cb23b965e2f9", "ja": "光り奏でる BlueMoon Harmony!", "zh": "闪亮演奏 BlueMoon Harmony!", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8017077b62ccb4af5a96efe8a4f70d14d8f2b9ba2ad0073b60a1acd35a12d479", "ja": "天体をモチーフにした定期公演、\n『BlueMoon Harmony!』のライブを\n間近に控えた、アイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "以天体为概念的定期公演──\n『BlueMoon Harmony!』的演唱会就快开始了，\n这是偶像们在此期间的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20d4599d2708f4b3ebc12dc60d135d85e8316941d42e8568b16745faaf2dddf2", "ja": "（天体テーマ公演の評判は上々。今日はメンバー全員\n揃っての『BlueMoon Harmony!』特別ライブだ）", "zh": "（天体主题公演的评价很不错，而今天是全员齐聚的\n『BlueMoon Harmony!』特别演唱会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c21dca92172e91d1f4835bf6444cfefe31e40dc5d868465a345602a9ab738a05", "ja": "あれ、どうしたんだ、紬、可憐。\nもうすぐ出番だから、緊張してるのか？", "zh": "咦？䌷、可怜，你们怎么了？\n马上就要出场了，你们很紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5eefe19e7167d0ff36757d1fb74ef4eb8367a8e12296410cbb5f25eb21460e7e", "ja": "……言わないと、わかりませんか？", "zh": "……我不说，你就不懂吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "186338b75277ed91f65caec953c2fc3110f55c37882c70e3f9c0a1e2417afee8", "ja": "わ、わかった。\nいや、わかってたけど、よりわかった。", "zh": "我、我懂了。\n不，我本来就知道，不过现在更清楚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "9e9462a9dd8db20311e03a1d1e9f38f314b061a0302e80845902b6ecf18066cb", "ja": "わ、私も……。さっきから緊張しちゃって……。\nふ、震えを止めなきゃって精一杯で……。", "zh": "我、我也是……从刚刚开始就很紧张……\n满、满脑子只想着不能发抖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "a840a184ad1222f4ded5dcdc5888343e17b115b8e5629dae5dc86654cc4885bf", "ja": "ラ、ラベンダーの香りにはリラックス効果があるから、\nアロマポット、持ってくればよかったですね……。", "zh": "薰、薰衣草的香气有助于放松心情，\n要是我有把扩香仪带来就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "f34891d15c79e3053965e7fdea6fdb6a757fbad62a5d946b001e53001dffe485", "ja": "篠宮さん、白石さん、安心してください。\n私たちもついています。", "zh": "筿宫、白石，请你们放心。\n还有我们在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "5e0f92146d39c26cfe92e55e0064af6ff0c4e35b80f65112e5d423cbb22fa3a9", "ja": "あ、瑞希さん……？\nそれに恵美ちゃん、百合子ちゃんも……。", "zh": "啊，瑞希……？\n还有惠美跟百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "74e5d492d389152d4895a3e2ce6e6c417fc002eb449274da0f2f675cf23e0443", "ja": "可憐さん、紬さん、大丈夫です！　伝説のアイドルも、\n出番の前は緊張するんですから、ふつうのことです！", "zh": "可怜、䌷，没问题的！就算是传说中的偶像，\n在出场前也会紧张，所以这很正常啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "b3f8aefd9e29eec4523704c92629d819dcaa50dcc7cc73853f13aa13f0516f78", "ja": "って、伝説のアイドルってなに、百合子？\n瑞希が伝説のアイドルーってコト？", "zh": "不过百合子，传说中的偶像是什么？\n你是说瑞希是传说中的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "589421ce100b6d69417d8dfcb4af76ac7f63b59408fe9f7bfcdb7889b6796062", "ja": "なんと。私が伝説のアイドル……。\n自分のことなのに、全然知りませんでした。", "zh": "什么？我竟然是传说中的偶像……\n明明是关于自己的事情，我却完全不知情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "fbb1203c0bcd73c41f2f87086698d72a525026c191b135b5b33d80ba7a3fc354", "ja": "ああっ、すみません！　伝説のアイドルっていうのは、\n私が昨日読んだ小説の主人公のことで……！", "zh": "啊，不好意思！传说中的偶像\n其实是指我昨天看的小说主角……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "aa19b3432d727a34fac82e69939825eca39ce8c6d0fc842d18f3ed3aab71fcf9", "ja": "そうでしたか……ではつまり、篠宮さんも白石さんも、\n伝説のアイドルも、私も緊張する、ということですね。", "zh": "原来是这样……那么也就是说，筿宫跟白石，\n还有传说中的偶像跟我，都会紧张吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dbfbac32ff1ae34b8ddeb46f32bdca4eb7cfdd43c3f426c825ac179974e4c994", "ja": "って、瑞希も緊張してたんだな？", "zh": "瑞希你也很紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "c020581c421f4b6b0c0393a57f9febb15962297661739ec397549d49dc3861f7", "ja": "はい、とても緊張していました。\nでも、一人より二人。二人より三人……。", "zh": "是的，我原本非常紧张。不过，当紧张的人\n从只有自己一人变成两个人，又变成三个人的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "6bcb1c885239e7bb2b5f3d0b1568b3c340a44579d8679f1b53f4c3ed04f78967", "ja": "緊張仲間がいれば、あまり怖くありません。衣装も緊張\nも、みんな同じ……。そう思うと、心が軽くなります。", "zh": "有其他一起紧张的伙伴，就没那么害怕了。只要想着\n大家服装相同，紧张的情绪也相同……心情就会变轻松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "1a8865554222c3e5c7c90107e340a97ccac55ed95d61bebbca0350162d23e3f3", "ja": "そ、そうですよねっ。みんなで作るステージだからと\n思って、私もずっと、緊張してたんですけど……。", "zh": "说、说得也是！我之前也一直很紧张，\n因为要跟大家合力完成表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "813bc35fcb948c075fd4ecc0df004906664dc78b2cbac7b2bc0828bdf7953b53", "ja": "今は逆ですっ。みんなで作るステージだから、\nどうしたって上手く行く気がしてきました！", "zh": "但现在我的想法完全不同了！\n正因为是大家合力完成的表演，所以一定会很顺利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fd71439538e7118d19cb2a0a956c05427d3509479c0747b4b13c7200bfcd8ac2", "ja": "……よし。それは楽観的すぎる気がするけど、\nこの際だからそれでいいぞ！", "zh": "……好。虽然这种想法感觉有点太乐观，\n不过都这种时候了，就抱着这样的心情上台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "c8b8fc9d2ef301c8915530366801b10b25fcfca2f5bc9c39fe196243920f7616", "ja": "ふふっ。でも、瑞希さんの言う通りみたい……。\nわ、私も……ホッとしちゃった……♪", "zh": "呵呵。不过，感觉就跟瑞希讲的一样……\n我、我也……放松下来了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "af8b7b59cade59323612e9408d3d4788f80821fa7238796c7e2427c05ae2b673", "ja": "そう……ですね。そもそも私は、ひとりで勝手に\n舞い上がっていただけなのかもしれません……。", "zh": "说得……也是。\n我刚刚可能是自己想太多了，静不下心来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "470fba38f4424f9be645165a98547c9d5e914752256644738c959be616bca405", "ja": "フッ、カレンもムギも真面目だからな。\nまあ、なんとかなるって。気楽にいこうぜ！", "zh": "呵，毕竟可怜跟䌷都很认真嘛。\n反正总会有办法的，我们就放轻松点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "f51fc8296f7dfda11dd18d86a84b7ef6e240629c37fdb4ef4d9b7bdc2048e605", "ja": "それから、今日はわたくしが一番の年長者です。\n困ったことがあったら、遠慮なく頼ってくださいまし。", "zh": "还有，今天这里最年长的是本小姐。\n如果大家碰到什么问题，请尽管来依靠本小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "7e0ba951ca908de99725d0f871ee2c56cb9ff1b22cdd0c5cf2ad2fd252a5a128", "ja": "でも千鶴、ついさっきまでレッスンルームで練習して\nなかった？　オレ、話しかけられなかったよ～。", "zh": "不过千鹤，你是不是一直到刚刚都还在\n练习室里练习啊？我都找不到时间跟你说话呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "3e621d78cedff2bcb7334d8420a70e1344b6f0788c3676ded21dbf2546175c81", "ja": "み、見ていましたの！？", "zh": "你、你看到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c2570874a7776343dab052f1e10b158cc096b825b7f4b2a962ed8d6412b1a6ca", "ja": "えっ。千鶴さんに不安なことが……？", "zh": "咦？千鹤你有什么不放心的地方吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "20dea00941e10aa56dcae1701e84c4975d0a339e7db48625f16efa292423926e", "ja": "違いますわ！　あれは、念のための最終確認というか\n……つまり、セレブの身だしなみのようなもの！", "zh": "才没有！那是本小姐为了预防万一在做最后确认……\n可以说就像是名流的自我要求那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "e18076adb8e6898c8458346c17a50c6c1ede6659e14c407665220485fc62627f", "ja": "確認を終えた今、わたくしはパーフェクトな\nセレブでしてよ！　オーッホッホッホッホ……ゲホッ！", "zh": "现在确认完后，本小姐已经是完美的名流了！\n哦～呵呵呵呵……咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "9a736fd67ebb6367195075195ccea51ef5df1a66d2a3551f40161f71e1a36ca7", "ja": "すっげー！　じゃあ千鶴、オレとかみんなが失敗しそう\nになったら、助けてくれよな！　頼りにしてるぜ！", "zh": "好厉害！那么千鹤，当我跟大家感觉要出错的时候，\n就请你帮助我们了！拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "80ee48d887799c3f4a0f3f954cd147738caa5ae5efc24d0cb4956d1a007853c3", "ja": "もちろん、お任せくださいまし……え、みんな？", "zh": "当然没问题，请交给本小姐……咦？大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "c8e34b02179e7a47d39db7278154280d03dd0b13cad2d8374c03a98bd9fff53b", "ja": "にゃはは♪　結局みんな緊張しいってコトだよね♪\nアタシもなんか安心しちゃった！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪结果大家都很容易紧张呢♪\n这样一来我好像也安心多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "30060a1b83efa7446641283785175b510858cb05f65bdc18b02cba3804a2097c", "ja": "はい。今日のステージは、とても楽しめそうな気が\nしてきました。……頑張るぞ。おー。", "zh": "是啊，我开始觉得自己应该能尽情享受\n今天的表演了……我要加油啰，喔──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "1775cb994ec48ef537d35fc2f6a2a0843542a630dbefa77551a745479465c752", "ja": "本当にみんな、いい顔になってきたな！\n……そして、ちょうど時間も来たみたいだ。", "zh": "大家现在看起来都神采奕奕呢！\n……然后，也刚好要准备上台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "063396a6d34ee34faef79dd1911697ebfdc9200be39f971e171ca0bc8a7e1928", "ja": "さあ、みんな。夜空に輝く月として、\n空に昇る準備はできてるか？", "zh": "好了，大家。\n准备好作为闪耀的明月，升上夜空了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "bf5e46545948549734dfaa164d3118b9330c859b19932e91e1172490c4c9d827", "ja": "もっちろん！　あ、でもさ、月は月でも、\n普通の月じゃないんだっけ？", "zh": "当然！啊，不过就算说是月亮，\n好像也不是一般的月亮吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "9a46915ccceb7939adac797edc8b72dc809b698392d55147335e69ded4d17285", "ja": "ああ、シズが言ってただろ？　ファンの声援に、\n仲間たちの絆。すべてを光にかえて輝く、大きな月。", "zh": "嗯，之前静说过吧？粉丝的声援以及伙伴们的情谊……\n将这些全都化为光芒，发出光辉的巨大月亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_013_cc_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_013_cc_02_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "790b76f6cd46e3b59f3f8bad8179bd17c6d53e53a13f8ae6a109eb58e5b05b4f", "ja": "それがウチら、『BlueMoon Harmony!』だ！\n行こうぜ、みんな！", "zh": "那就是我们『BlueMoon Harmony!』！\n走吧，大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
